ey ot:LegalStatusCourtAppointedHealthWelfare ot:LegalStatusCourtAppointedPropertyFinances ot:LegalStatusDoLS ot:LegalStatusSection117 ot:NRPF ot:Risk ot:Risk ot:RiskModernDaySlavery ot:RiskExploitation ot:RiskFalling ot:SlowToReact ot:SupportReason ot:SupportReasonPhysicalAccessMobility ot:SupportReasonPhysicalPersonalCare ot:SupportReasonSensoryVisual ot:SupportReasonSensoryHearing ot:SupportReasonSensoryDual ot:SupportReasonMemoryCognition ot:SupportReasonLearningDisability ot:SupportReasonMentalHealth ot:SupportReasonSubstanceMisuse ot:SupportReasonAsylumSeeker ot:SupportReasonSocialIsolationOther ot:SupportReasonUnpaidCarer ot:SupportReasonUnknown ot:VisualImpairment ot:VisualImpairmentBlind ot:VisualImpairmentPartiallySighted ot:VisualImpairmentNoImpairment ot:VisualImpairmentSeverityUnknown ot:VisualImpairmentUnknown ) ;
